{
  "name": "ua-parser",
  "description": "A multi-language port of Browserscope's user agent parser, providing robust extraction of browser, operating system, and device metadata from User-Agent strings. It utilizes a shared, YAML-based configuration of regular expressions to ensure consistent parsing behavior across JavaScript, Python, Java, C#, PHP, Perl, and Haskell implementations. The system is designed for high-performance telemetry and analytics pipelines requiring precise identification of client-side environments.",
